[h1]Cosmic Chronicles[/h1]
[i]The definitive narrative, dynamic event, and lore expansion module for the Cosmic Series.[/i]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]What is Cosmic Chronicles?[/h2]
Have you ever docked at a station and wondered what the locals are actually thinking? Space can sometimes feel a little quiet. [b]Cosmic Chronicles[/b] changes that by transforming the cold math of background simulations into human stories. It introduces the "Rumormonger" system, which actively listens to the economy, wars, and your reputation to generate contextual dialogue, alongside massive deep-space exploration events!

[b]⚠️ REQUIRED DEPENDENCY:[/b] Cosmic Chronicles is part of the "Core 5" Cosmic Series mods which are hard dependencies for each other. You [b]must[/b] be subscribed to all [b]REQUIRED ITEMS[/b] to play!

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Core Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]🗣️ [b]The Rumormonger System:[/b] Stations no longer yell random static text. They dynamically assess the sector's War Heat, Faction Wealth, Station Type, and Player Reputation to deliver perfectly contextual, localized chatter!
[*]📚 [b]Over 400+ Dynamic Lore Snippets:[/b] Hear civilians panic about trade sanctions, military bases preparing for sieges, or poor stations complaining about broken equipment.
[*]🗺️ [b]Captain's Logs:[/b] Completing background map commands (Mine, Trade, Scout) now dynamically attaches narrative logs to your mail reports based on the geopolitical climate!
[*]🛸 [b]Deep Space Events:[/b] Jump into empty sectors to discover Refugee Convoys, Drifting Ghost Ships, Rogue AI Probes, or Stranded Diplomats based on the state of the galaxy. Some refugees carry a hushed tip on nearby stash coordinates, if you know how to earn their trust.
[*]🔥 [b]Echoes of the Frontline (Graveyards):[/b] If War Heat > 80, you may discover massive Derelict Graveyards: the smoking aftermath of a fleet battle!
[*]🗃️ [b]Black Box Extraction:[/b] Scavenge Black Boxes from graveyards for doomed captain audio logs, massive credits, and High-Tier System Upgrades! Scavengers extract 50% more value, Explorers 25% more, and anything pulled from Eclipse territory pays double.
[*]🏛️ [b]Cinematic Cultural Monuments:[/b] Discover colossal procedural monuments in ancient territory. Paying respects grants a permanent +2500 reputation boost!
[*]💼 [b]Captain Synergies:[/b] Smugglers and Explorers can extract rumors from hostile stations. Merchants negotiate hazard pay for refugees, while Scavengers decrypt Black Boxes for extra value and Exceptional drops!
[*]📰 [b]Galactic News Network:[/b] A full player UI newsboard with category filters, search, sortable columns, and unread tracking. The Breaking News banner fires server-wide the moment an AI faction is wiped from the galaxy entirely.
[*]💰 [b]Bounties & The Rift Exchange:[/b] Newsboard bounty contracts pay out up to 2.5 million credits, and Encrypted Log Fragments can be turned in at Research Stations for a flat 1 million credits each.
[*]🚨 [b]Ascendancy & Rift Interoperability:[/b] Recover classified Rift Research Data for the Black Market, and beware corrupted Eclipse lore nodes that trigger massive ambushes!
[/list]

